        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-space-lg relative z-10">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.4)]">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[36px]">sports_kabaddi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
            <h2 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg font-black text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tight">
              Pronto para o próximo treino?
            </h2>
            <p class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-semibold">
              Garanta sua presença no tatame e acelere sua evolução na faixa.
            </p>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl mx-auto">
              Baixe o aplicativo oficial agora mesmo e leve a gestão do seu Jiu-Jitsu para o nível dos atletas profissionais.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-space-md pt-space-xs w-full sm:w-auto">
            <a
              class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-xl py-4 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-secondary-container text-on-primary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-[0_4px_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.4)] active:scale-95"
